      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There needs to be a double fix. Both a confirmation of some sort is needed before a portal takes you somewhere so you can decline/hide the portal if you do not want to enter, because sometimes you meet people and go through portals from those people that are not your friends. The second fix would be a portal option where only friends can drop it for you but still retaining that confirmation fix so there is no accidentally walking through a portal.\n\nI also do not want to see portals from users I have blocked. That fix would also stop client users spawning portals when I have blocked them.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
